OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure as crews tackle fire
OL,4,Aat block of flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road closure has been put in place as
OL,7,Fcrews remain at the scene of a blaze at
OL,8,Fa block of flats.
OL,10,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,11,FRescue Service (HIWFRS) said it was
OL,12,Fcalled at about 13:00 BST to a fire
OL,13,Finvolving the stairwell and roof space
OL,14,Fof a block of flats on Garfield Road in
OL,15,FRyde.
OL,17,FHIWFRS said the fire in the stairwell
OL,18,Fhad now been extinguished, with crews
OL,19,Ffrom Newport, Ryde, Shanklin, Cowes,
OL,20,FSandown and Ventnor continuing to damp
OL,21,Fdown the roof space and monitor the
OL,22,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
